          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of মেঝে (mejhe) is not settled. CDIAL has no Bengali word for \"floor\" of this shape; the nearest it gives is mejha, \"the middle\", under Sanskrit madhyama, \"middle\" (CDIAL 9810), and it does not connect the two."
